🚨 Maintenance Notes
Change carefully

The following areas have high impact on the stability of the integration:

• Test Plan naming rules
• execution naming rules
• report folder resolution logic
• XML file selection logic
• Test Plan reuse logic
• response parsing from Jira
• attachment packaging filters
• evidence matching rules
• timing fallback calculations in the GAIA report

A small change in one of these areas can cause the integration to:

• publish to the wrong Test Plan
• fail to find the XML result
• miss attachments
• create duplicate Test Plans
• attach the wrong screenshot to a failed scenario
